silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_01_concrete_anchor_cocone_leg_n_plus_1#bodymassqualityattachmentarrowstage2 silm:hasLongDescription "The BodyMassQualityAttachmentArrowStage2 is For l=BodyMassQuality77 and n+1=2, the cocone leg is the SAME arrow as at stage 1 (the body-mass attachment to Mittens). The microchip-read event does not modify this arrow; it adds a different arrow (MicrochipIdentifier9 -> Mittens) beside it." .
